{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42303","headline":"池州陈使君见示游齐山诗因寄 · 徐铉","name":"池州陈使君见示游齐山诗因寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往岁曾游弄水亭，齐峰浓翠暮轩横。\n哀猨出槛心虽喜，伤鸟闻弦势易惊。\n病後簪缨殊寡兴，老来泉石倍关情。\n今朝池口风波静，遥贺山前有颂声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42303.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42303","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}